{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/451646-data-form-question","id":451646,"title":"Data-form question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-21T10:05:44-07:00","id":451646,"title":"Data-form question","content":"I was reading dataform and I felt that this demon form might be broken because of this quote<br /> &quot;This Process costs one point of Aether per turn.<br /> Dataform is activated as an instant action. If the demon becomes<br /> data without a method of transmission, she stays exactly<br /> where she was, until she reforms.&quot;<br /> <br /> So if you have this and you are in full demon form you now can't move if you can't transmit your self. Unless I missed something how can this power be useful. I mean I understand it lets you transmit your self over the internet but come on. 1 Aether per turn.<br /> <br /> Anyone got an ideas how this power is useful ?<br /> <br /> So far I have been trying to find ways to fix this. <br /> <br /> 1. This form should make it so you can easily control any electronic around you.<br /> 2. It should not cost per turn to be in this form. <br /> 3. Maybe this power lets you travel not just through lines but into the digital world of the internet as a different kind of computer hacking. <br /> <br /> This is just a few ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:11:07-07:00","id":451667,"title":"","content":"If you are touching a computer, cell phone, landline, or literally anything else with some kind of network connection you can travel through it, to <i>any other device</i> connected to that same network. It's basically global teleportation. For 1 or 2 Aether.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:13:42-07:00","id":451671,"title":"","content":"I still this per turn is kind of high if you can even move around. Because if your in full demon form you can't move.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:56:40-07:00","id":451757,"title":"","content":"You can activate if you want, its not full demon automatic and obligatory data form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:02:16-07:00","id":451866,"title":"","content":"That &quot;until she reforms&quot; bit is key: a demon in Dataform without a means of transmission is effectively <i>nonexistent</i> until she stops spending Aether.<br /> <br /> She's also immobile, but in full demonic form you can ostensibly keep this up indefinitely until an escape valve presents itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:26:44-07:00","id":451915,"title":"","content":"I'm not seeing an issue with it. Its not really a combat ability,but transportation and infiltration are made a lot easier. Yes you can't move, but as it has been pointed out you choose when to turn it on. Meaning most of the time you can move and once you can get to a transmission point we're talking near instant long range teleportation,so I rarely see it costing more than 2 points. (one to activate and one on the turn where you arrive.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:29:34-07:00","id":451919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/451646-data-form-question?p=451915#post451915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not seeing an issue with it. Its not really a combat ability,but transportation and infiltration are made a lot easier. Yes you can't move, but as it has been pointed out you choose when to turn it on. Meaning most of the time you can move and once you can get to a transmission point we're talking near instant long range teleportation,so I rarely see it costing more than 2 points. (one to activate and one on the turn where you arrive.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This. I found it fairly straightforward and pretty damn badass for long distance missions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1353-riche","name":"RichE","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:45:03-07:00","id":451949,"title":"","content":"What book is this from anyway?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T13:57:23-07:00","id":452001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/451646-data-form-question?p=451949#post451949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What book is this from anyway?</div> </div> </div> </div>Flowers of Hell","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T14:45:19-07:00","id":452029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Tin Soldier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/451646-data-form-question?p=452001#post452001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Flowers of Hell</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T16:11:35-07:00","id":452113,"title":"","content":"Dataform's super useful in my experience, yeah. You can basically teleport across the goddamn planet for one to three points of Aether, which ain't anything to sneeze at in nWoD. My character, who normally serves as distant backup and coordination, has used it to blip in and out of a project site being infiltrated, speed-hack its electronic functions in an emergency, it's expensive but sometimes burning all that Aether is damn well worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T22:49:39-07:00","id":452313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flowers of Hell p.128</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dataform is activated as an instant action.</div> </div> </div> </div>This line means that it doesn't matter if the Demonic Form is activated on your Demon, you still need to declare that Data Form itself is being activated. This is why it's an instant action. This means that if you use Partial Transformation to activate Data Form on your Demon it <i>does not </i>automatically transform you into data but readies the ability. You then have to declare you're activating the power itself. This also means that when you use Full Transformation you <i>do not</i> instantly transform into data and become immobile until you activate Data Form as an instant action.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T22:58:59-07:00","id":452316,"title":"","content":"Ah! If that's the misunderstanding, then yes. Dataform is like Insect Swarm: it's not a descriptor of what your demonic form is always like, it's an alternate form your demonic form can assume. Or to put it another way, it's like Rain of Fire; it's a power you're capable of using when your demonic form is manifest. Similarly to how a demon with Rain of Fire doesn't cause fire to rain down from the sky constantly whenever he assumes demonic form, a demon with Dataform is still naturally physically manifest and walking around even in demonic form, not a packet of data floating in the air and uncontrollably bleeding Aether. He's just a demon who <i>can</i> become a packet of data when he has the Aether to keep it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T20:03:38-07:00","id":453717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/451646-data-form-question?p=452113#post452113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dataform's super useful in my experience, yeah. You can basically teleport across the goddamn planet for one to three points of Aether, which ain't anything to sneeze at in nWoD. My character, who normally serves as distant backup and coordination, has used it to blip in and out of a project site being infiltrated, speed-hack its electronic functions in an emergency, it's expensive but sometimes burning all that Aether is damn well worth it.</div> </div> </div> </div>See, Data Form being as useful as it is, is one of the reasons why I think one should be able to combine the effect of Clarivoyant Sight and Teleport. Each has it's own checks and balances with regard to long distance movement. Data Form is a single form power but requires locations with internet access and may cost more than 1 Aether. Clarivoyant Sight and Teleport require two form powers to potentially achieve long distance teleportation, is limited by locations visited in the last month, and may end up with the Captivated condition; however it only costs 1 Aether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T08:33:48-07:00","id":483554,"title":"","content":"It means you can have perfect stealth for 1 aether/round. This is awesome. It means you can set off a bomb and turn to data and survive the effect. It makes you immune to most things for 1 aether/round. It think that is good.<br /> <br /> It gives you a lot of choices. There are stealth embeds.exploits/forms. There are travel ones and ones for defence. This gives you them all at once. If you are stuck in a burning building with no way out as the ceiling has fallen on your leg. You could turn to data for a while waiting for back up to come for example (maybe even get your leg out as the rubble falls as your leg is no longer there)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}